# {{appName}}

StarUI external-consumer app scaffolded by `@wellsfargo-starui/mcp-scaffold`.

## Prerequisites

- Node.js 20+
- npm 10

## Install & run

```bash
npm ci
npm run dev
```

Dev server: http://localhost:{{port}}

## Design system & AG Grid theme

- `@import '@wellsfargo-starui/design-system/css'` and `@import '@wellsfargo-starui/grid/styles.css'` in `src/globals.css`
- Boot: `applyTheme(getTheme())` in `src/main.tsx` sets `[data-theme]` on `<html>`
- MarketsGrid resolves AG Grid theme via `useGridTheme()` → `@wellsfargo-starui/design-system/adapters/ag-grid` (`agGridDarkTheme` / `agGridLightTheme`)
- App chrome uses **shadcn primitives from `@wellsfargo-starui/ui` only** — no native form elements

## StarUI packages

Installed from bundled tarballs in `libs/` (see `libs/manifest.json`).

## Template: basic

Static `MarketsGrid` with bond inventory and localStorage profile persistence.

